WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.430
A long stone corridor.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.410
Door after door.

3
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.160
A gloved hand tries each handle.

4
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:11.800
A guest in a lonely castle
wonders if he is a guest at all.

5
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:16.700
In a London house, a young man climbs
to the top room and turns the key.

6
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.070
Inside, a covered picture.

7
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.230
Locked rooms.

8
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.920
Family secrets.

9
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.990
So why does the Gothic
keep coming back to them?

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.920
In this mission, you'll
learn the Gothic's toolkit,

11
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.020
one convention at a time.

12
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.480
You'll explore the castle
with Jonathan Harker,

13
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.800
and the top room with Dorian Gray.

14
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:38.670
And you'll ask what each of
those locked doors is keeping in.

15
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.050
Your mission: explain why the Gothic keeps
going back to those rooms and secrets.
